Sebelum makan, taburi ini dulu.

251
00:12:59,928 --> 00:13:02,095
Apa itu?

252
00:13:02,118 --> 00:13:05,185
Garam.

253
00:13:05,209 --> 00:13:07,825
Kita taburi garam di semangka.

254
00:13:07,848 --> 00:13:09,082
Hah?

255
00:13:09,106 --> 00:13:12,883
Semangka ditaburi garam?

256
00:13:12,906 --> 00:13:16,597
Semangka kan makanan manis.

257
00:13:16,620 --> 00:13:19,587
Kenapa harus ditaburi garam?

258
00:13:19,610 --> 00:13:24,108
Karena kalau ditaburi garam, rasanya jadi lebih manis.

259
00:13:24,131 --> 00:13:26,064
Beneran?

260
00:13:26,087 --> 00:13:28,287
Gak percaya deh.

261
00:13:28,310 --> 00:13:32,244
Coba aja, anggap aja lagi dicoba.

262
00:13:32,267 --> 00:13:34,200
Baiklah.

263
00:13:34,223 --> 00:13:37,068
Aku taburin sedikit aja.

264
00:13:37,092 --> 00:13:39,063
Rasanya gimana?

265
00:13:39,086 --> 00:13:42,623
Wah, beneran ya!

266
00:13:42,646 --> 00:13:45,653
Jadi lebih manis banget.

267
00:13:45,677 --> 00:13:49,210
Aneh tapi enak.

268
00:13:49,233 --> 00:13:52,000
Senang kamu suka.

269
00:13:52,023 --> 00:13:54,556
Makan yang banyak ya.

270
00:13:54,579 --> 00:13:56,312
Ya,

271
00:13:56,335 --> 00:14:00,902
Budaya Jepang benar-benar menarik, ya.

272
00:14:00,925 --> 00:14:02,425
Scene 7: Jelajahi Tempat Wisata Retro & Cara Menikmati Ramune

273
00:14:02,425 --> 00:14:07,239
Hari ini kita datang ke tempat wisata yang bergaya retro, ya.

274
00:14:07,263 --> 00:14:10,130
Ada toko jajanan tradisional lho.

275
00:14:10,153 --> 00:14:11,953
Ayo masuk.

276
00:14:11,976 --> 00:14:15,670
Wah, ada ramune dingin dijual.

277
00:14:15,693 --> 00:14:17,826
Ramune?

278
00:14:17,849 --> 00:14:21,226
Botol kacanya cantik sekali.

279
00:14:21,250 --> 00:14:22,984
Beli yuk.

280
00:14:23,007 --> 00:14:25,092
Ini, silakan.

281
00:14:25,116 --> 00:14:26,849
Terima kasih.

282
00:14:26,872 --> 00:14:30,719
Terus, gimana cara minumnya?

283
00:14:30,742 --> 00:14:33,709
Tutupnya nggak ada ya.

284
00:14:33,732 --> 00:14:37,732
Coba tekan tutup plastiknya.

285
00:14:37,755 --> 00:14:39,688
Ini?

286
00:14:39,711 --> 00:14:44,121
Wah, ada kelereng masuk ke dalam.

287
00:14:44,145 --> 00:14:45,982
Iya, gitu.

288
00:14:46,005 --> 00:14:50,491
Kalau kelerengnya masuk, baru bisa diminum lho.

289
00:14:50,515 --> 00:14:53,248
Mekanismenya unik banget ya.

290
00:14:53,271 --> 00:14:56,604
Yuk, kita makan.

291
00:14:56,627 --> 00:15:00,227
Eh, kok minumannya nggak keluar.

292
00:15:00,250 --> 00:15:03,926
Sudah dimiringkan banyak belum?

293
00:15:03,950 --> 00:15:07,483
Sudah, dimiringkan banyak.

294
00:15:07,506 --> 00:15:09,959
Tapi tetap nggak keluar.

295
00:15:09,983 --> 00:15:15,881
Oh, kelerengnya nyangkut di mulut botol nih.

296
00:15:15,904 --> 00:15:19,870
Iya bener, nyangkut ya.

297
00:15:19,893 --> 00:15:22,227
Terus gimana dong?

298
00:15:22,250 --> 00:15:27,666
Di mulut botol ada bagian yang sedikit cekung.

299
00:15:27,689 --> 00:15:30,456
Bagian yang cekung?

300
00:15:30,479 --> 00:15:33,045
Oh, ini ya.

301
00:15:33,068 --> 00:15:36,526
Coba kaitkan kelerengnya di situ.

302
00:15:36,550 --> 00:15:38,283
Oh, gitu.

303
00:15:38,306 --> 00:15:41,515
Kelerengnya ditahan di situ ya.

304
00:15:41,539 --> 00:15:45,139
Kalau begitu, kelerengnya nggak jatuh.

305
00:15:45,162 --> 00:15:47,815
Coba deh.

306
00:15:47,838 --> 00:15:50,604
Wah, keluar!

307
00:15:50,627 --> 00:15:52,903
Bisa diminum?

308
00:15:52,927 --> 00:15:55,261
Syukurlah.

309
00:15:55,284 --> 00:16:00,140
Iya, minuman bersodanya enak banget.

310
00:16:00,163 --> 00:16:05,097
Tapi agak susah juga ya minumnya.

311
00:16:05,121 --> 00:16:07,773
Perlu triknya nih.

312
00:16:07,796 --> 00:16:10,964
Kalau sudah terbiasa, gampang kok.

313
00:16:10,988 --> 00:16:15,521
Suara kelerengnya berdenting-denting itu merdu banget.

314
00:16:15,544 --> 00:16:18,559
Suaranya bikin suasana musim panas, ya.

315
00:16:18,583 --> 00:16:23,616
Iya, rasanya kayak musim panas di Jepang.

316
00:16:23,639 --> 00:16:26,093
Mau beli satu lagi?

317
00:16:26,117 --> 00:16:28,127
Asyik tuh.

318
00:16:28,151 --> 00:16:31,951
Kali ini pasti bisa minum dengan lancar.

319
00:16:31,974 --> 00:16:33,474
Scene 8: Bersantap Hamo di Kawadoko Saat Musim Panas

320
00:16:33,474 --> 00:16:37,725
Musim panas di Kyoto panas banget ya.

321
00:16:37,748 --> 00:16:39,882
Iya, betul.

322
00:16:39,905 --> 00:16:43,842
Tapi di sini sejuk lho.

323
00:16:43,865 --> 00:16:48,799
Iya, ada restoran di atas sungai.

324
00:16:48,822 --> 00:16:52,756
Ini disebut kawadoko.

325
00:16:52,779 --> 00:16:57,272
Bisa lihat air sungai, cantik sekali.

326
00:16:57,296 --> 00:17:00,496
Anginnya enak banget ya.

327
00:17:00,518 --> 00:17:04,328
Nah, makanannya sudah datang.

328
00:17:04,352 --> 00:17:07,685
Ikan putih yang cantik ya.

329
00:17:07,708 --> 00:17:10,042
Ini ikan apa?

330
00:17:10,065 --> 00:17:14,031
Ini ikan yang disebut Hamo.

331
00:17:14,054 --> 00:17:17,621
Ikan mewah di musim panas, lho.

332
00:17:17,644 --> 00:17:19,244
Hamo?

333
00:17:19,267 --> 00:17:22,000
Belum pernah dengar sebelumnya.

334
00:17:22,023 --> 00:17:26,657
Disebut 'yubiki', sudah disiram air panas.

335
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:30,046
Cocol dengan saus prem, lalu makan ya.

336
00:17:30,069 --> 00:17:32,313
Kelihatannya enak ya.

337
00:17:32,337 --> 00:17:34,138
Selamat makan.

338
00:17:34,162 --> 00:17:39,295
Eh, ikan ini kok nggak ada tulangnya?

339
00:17:39,318 --> 00:17:43,751
Bukan, sebenarnya banyak tulangnya.

340
00:17:43,774 --> 00:17:48,647
Wah, banyak tulangnya?

341
00:17:48,671 --> 00:17:50,071
Baik.

342
00:17:50,094 --> 00:17:53,694
Tapi nggak apa-apa.

343
00:17:53,717 --> 00:17:59,484
Tukang masaknya sudah memotong tulangnya dengan pisau secara halus.

344
00:17:59,507 --> 00:18:02,313
Memotong tulangnya?

345
00:18:02,336 --> 00:18:03,993
Baik.

346
00:18:04,016 --> 00:18:08,550
Itu teknik khusus yang disebut 'bone cutting'.

347
00:18:08,573 --> 00:18:13,706
Jadi meski ada tulangnya, bisa langsung dimakan.

348
00:18:13,729 --> 00:18:16,496
Tekniknya luar biasa ya.

349
00:18:16,518 --> 00:18:19,165
Baiklah, saya coba makan.

350
00:18:19,189 --> 00:18:23,859
Wah, sangat lembut!

351
00:18:23,883 --> 00:18:27,250
Tulangnya sama sekali nggak terasa.

352
00:18:27,273 --> 00:18:29,113
Syukurlah.

353
00:18:29,136 --> 00:18:32,469
Saus premnya cocok banget.

354
00:18:32,492 --> 00:18:34,026
Baik.

355
00:18:34,048 --> 00:18:38,382
Segar dan enak sekali.

356
00:18:38,405 --> 00:18:41,571
Ikan yang pas banget untuk musim panas.

357
00:18:41,594 --> 00:18:46,330
Bisa mengenal budaya Kyoto yang luar biasa.

358
00:18:46,354 --> 00:18:51,187
Pemandangannya indah, makanannya juga top banget.

359
00:18:51,210 --> 00:18:54,879
Terima kasih sudah diajak ke sini.

360
00:18:54,902 --> 00:19:00,469
Ah, masih banyak lagi makanan enak, lho.

361
00:19:00,492 --> 00:19:02,459
Nggak sabar nih!

362
00:19:02,482 --> 00:19:05,316
Makan pelan-pelan aja ya.

363
00:19:05,339 --> 00:19:06,839
Scene 9: Pertemuan Tak Terduga di Kafe

364
00:19:06,839 --> 00:19:11,639
Panaskan sekali, jalan jauh ya.

365
00:19:11,662 --> 00:19:15,906
Iya, haus banget.

366
00:19:15,930 --> 00:19:19,063
Yuk masuk ke warung makan ini.

367
00:19:19,086 --> 00:19:21,102
Asyik tuh.

368
00:19:21,126 --> 00:19:23,340
Sejuk banget di sini.

369
00:19:23,363 --> 00:19:26,763
Eh, tehnya sudah datang.

370
00:19:26,786 --> 00:19:31,052
Wah, minumannya dingin ya.

371
00:19:31,075 --> 00:19:34,209
Warnanya cokelat.

372
00:19:34,232 --> 00:19:39,466
Untungnya, dikasih es kopi gratis.

373
00:19:39,489 --> 00:19:43,059
Eh, es kopi?

374
00:19:43,083 --> 00:19:49,416
Iya, di negara saya warna ini berarti kopi.

375
00:19:49,439 --> 00:19:51,773
Mari diminum~

376
00:19:51,796 --> 00:19:55,196
Glek-glek.

377
00:19:55,219 --> 00:19:56,425
Eh?

378
00:19:56,449 --> 00:19:59,908
Rasanya beda banget.

379
00:19:59,931 --> 00:20:02,131
Nggak pahit?

380
00:20:02,154 --> 00:20:04,355
Nggak manis?

381
00:20:04,378 --> 00:20:09,391
Iya, nggak pahit juga nggak manis.

382
00:20:09,415 --> 00:20:12,262
Ini bukan kopi, lho.

383
00:20:12,285 --> 00:20:15,918
Ini teh yang disebut mugicha.

384
00:20:15,941 --> 00:20:20,708
Di warung makan Jepang, teh ini sering disajikan di musim panas.

385
00:20:20,731 --> 00:20:23,664
Bisa diminum gratis, lho.

386
00:20:23,687 --> 00:20:27,257
Gratisnya bikin senang banget, ya.

387
00:20:27,281 --> 00:20:29,287
Teh barley, ya?

388
00:20:29,310 --> 00:20:32,110
Ini pertama kali saya minum.

389
00:20:32,133 --> 00:20:35,975
Segar banget, bikin tenggorokan adem.

390
00:20:35,998 --> 00:20:40,198
Karena nggak ada kafein, jadi bagus buat tubuh.

391
00:20:40,221 --> 00:20:42,622
Oh, gitu ya.

392
00:20:42,645 --> 00:20:45,979
Enak banget diminumnya.

393
00:20:46,002 --> 00:20:51,301
Tadi pengen es kopi, tapi ini juga enak.

394
00:20:51,324 --> 00:20:53,757
Suka, nggak?

395
00:20:53,780 --> 00:20:55,747
Senang deh.

396
00:20:55,770 --> 00:21:00,570
Esnya banyak banget, dingin sekali.

397
00:21:00,593 --> 00:21:04,593
Maaf, boleh minta tambah?

398
00:21:04,616 --> 00:21:07,470
Silakan diminum sebanyak-banyaknya, ya.

399
00:21:07,493 --> 00:21:08,826
Baik.

400
00:21:08,849 --> 00:21:13,493
Di musim panas Jepang, teh barley itu wajib banget.

401
00:21:13,516 --> 00:21:16,749
Ayo, kita pesan sekarang.

402
00:21:16,772 --> 00:21:19,106
Mau makan apa?

403
00:21:19,129 --> 00:21:22,411
Saya pengen makan udon dingin.

404
00:21:22,434 --> 00:21:23,934
Scene 10: Kari Super Pedas di Hari yang Terik

405
00:21:23,934 --> 00:21:29,074
Hari ini panasnya luar biasa, ya.

406
00:21:29,097 --> 00:21:33,830
Mataharinya terik banget, rasanya bisa meleleh.

407
00:21:33,853 --> 00:21:37,747
Kalau hari panas begini, ayo ke toko ini.

408
00:21:37,771 --> 00:21:40,138
Toko kari, ya?

409
00:21:40,161 --> 00:21:43,197
Wangi banget, ya.

410
00:21:43,221 --> 00:21:48,089
Iya, kari pedas di sini terkenal.

411
00:21:48,112 --> 00:21:51,245
Eh, pedas banget?

412
00:21:51,268 --> 00:21:54,035
Karinya merah menyala, ya.

413
00:21:54,058 --> 00:21:57,946
Iya, pedasnya bukan main.

414
00:21:57,970 --> 00:22:00,349
Tunggu dulu.

415
00:22:00,373 --> 00:22:04,307
Tapi hari panas begini.

416
00:22:04,330 --> 00:22:08,530
Kenapa makan yang panas dan pedas?

417
00:22:08,553 --> 00:22:11,529
Bikin makin panas, lho.

418
00:22:11,552 --> 00:22:16,430
Kalau makan pedas, keringat keluar banyak.

419
00:22:16,454 --> 00:22:22,221
Setelah keringat keluar, badan jadi adem.

420
00:22:22,244 --> 00:22:27,584
Di Jepang, banyak orang makan pedas saat musim panas.

421
00:22:27,607 --> 00:22:30,376
Bikin semangat, kan.

422
00:22:30,399 --> 00:22:32,566
Beneran?

423
00:22:32,589 --> 00:22:35,122
Kayak bohong aja.

424
00:22:35,145 --> 00:22:37,745
Tapi oke, saya paham.

425
00:22:37,768 --> 00:22:39,972
Ayo, saya coba.

426
00:22:39,996 --> 00:22:42,573
Kari sudah datang, nih.

427
00:22:42,596 --> 00:22:44,396
Silakan.

428
00:22:44,419 --> 00:22:49,352
Wah, cuma baunya aja udah bikin keringetan.

429
00:22:49,375 --> 00:22:51,508
Selamat makan.

430
00:22:51,531 --> 00:22:55,098
P-pedas banget!

431
00:22:55,121 --> 00:22:57,354
Silakan minum air.

432
00:22:57,377 --> 00:22:59,990
A-a, nggak apa-apa?

433
00:23:00,014 --> 00:23:03,814
Minum air pun masih pedas.

434
00:23:03,837 --> 00:23:06,837
Mulut rasanya sakit.

435
00:23:06,860 --> 00:23:10,661
Tapi sendoknya nggak berhenti, ya.

436
00:23:10,684 --> 00:23:12,451
Baik.

437
00:23:12,474 --> 00:23:15,074
Pedas!

438
00:23:15,097 --> 00:23:19,064
Tapi enak banget.

439
00:23:19,087 --> 00:23:22,253
Soalnya ada umami-nya.

440
00:23:22,276 --> 00:23:25,876
Keringat bercucuran dari dahi.

441
00:23:25,899 --> 00:23:28,466
Menyegarkan, ya?

442
00:23:28,489 --> 00:23:30,226
Iya.

443
00:23:30,250 --> 00:23:34,135
Anehnya, rasanya jadi lebih segar.

444
00:23:34,159 --> 00:23:39,434
Coba, keluar dari toko rasanya lebih sejuk.

445
00:23:39,457 --> 00:23:41,702
Iya bener banget.

446
00:23:41,726 --> 00:23:45,328
Kayaknya nggak sepanas tadi deh.

447
00:23:45,351 --> 00:23:49,370
Kari pedas musim panas ini emang juara!

448
00:23:49,394 --> 00:23:51,401
Baik.

449
00:23:51,424 --> 00:23:54,791
Bisa bikin ketagihan nih.

450
00:23:54,814 --> 00:23:57,092
Yuk, kita datang lagi.